      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A parent reports the app does not go past 2nd grade and needs content for 3rd-4th grade.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "The only downside is it doesn’t go past 2nd grade! please consider making additional content for 3rd - 4th grade as I feel the regular website isn’t as engaging as the app."
    },
    {
      "ref": "R107",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A child reports learning is terrible and hates learning.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "I don’t like this game. I’m nine years old now this is. absolute horrible terrible and I hate learning learning is for losers. Learning is terrible, and everyone hates learning."
    },
    {
      "ref": "R122",
      "area": "age_gating",
      "claim": "A child reports the app is too easy for an 8-year-old turning 9 and wants more options for older kids.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "honestly there should be more options than 8+ bc im 8 turning 9 and this stuff is wayyy i mean WAYYY too easy for me i showed it to my ckassmates and they went throught it like a breeze there should be more optiojns for older kids."
    },
    {
      "ref": "R132",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A parent reports the app is the best learning app with no ads and free.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Best learning app out there! My son loves it and asks to play it everyday! Today we learned about nouns! Thank you for making a fantastic free learning app!"
    },
    {
      "ref": "R143",
      "area": "developer_record",
      "claim": "A reviewer calls the app the best learning app and says keep it up.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "Love this app! I mean.. what can I say? Perfect learning app for kids and probably the best learning app I’ve done. Keep it up!"
    },
    {
      "ref": "R148",
      "area": "lacking_parent_dashboard",
      "claim": "A parent reports there is no way to see child's progress or level.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Great app, helpful for the kids. However, the only way to see what they’ve done is in the library. There is no way to see your child’s progress or level, etc., which would be helpful."
    },
    {
      "ref": "R164",
      "area": "accessibility",
      "claim": "A parent reports the app lacks captions and is not accessible to deaf kids.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "My 6 year old’s teacher said she needs to improve her understanding of time, so I downloaded this app. The activities are good practice for what she needs to learn but the app is not accessible to deaf kids - no English captions and no ASL"
    },
    {
      "ref": "R165",
      "area": "content",
      "claim": "A reviewer says the app is too babyish and should teach art and animals.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "I think khan kids should teach you about art and animals and khan kids is to babyish!"
    },
    {
      "ref": "R170",
      "area": "money",
      "claim": "A reviewer states the app has no ads and is free.",
      "stance": "mitigation",
      "quote": "Best learning app out there! My son loves it and asks to play it everyday! Today we learned about nouns! Thank you for making a fantastic free learning app!"
    },
    {
      "ref": "R171",
      "area": "data",
      "claim": "A reviewer mentions offline mode is great for flights without wifi.",
      "stance": "neutral",
      "quote": "My daughter loves this app! It has helped her learn a lot. The offline mode is great especially on flights without WIFI, as she had a lot of options to keep her engaged!"
    },
